"edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T17:12:54-08:00","id":1273807,"title":"","content":"Reading through this, I'm quite pleased. I particularly like the &quot;5 years later&quot; addendums, which really resonated with how I like to view Vampire. Thank you.<br /> <br /> Any plans to expand this idea into other game lines, or from other devs?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":16,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","user":"Cielle","date":". 12-10-2018, 08:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","name":"Cielle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T20:38:46-08:00","id":1273835,"title":"","content":"Thank you so much, Rose. This is really wonderful.<br /> <br /> Edit: Just want to add -- in the past I've found it difficult to keep the tone/feel of VTR in line with what I really love about the core book. Like my head would slip into a very slightly different genre when playing (a touch too B movie here, a little too grimdark there). I found that calling to mind certain pieces of in-universe fiction helped to get me in the right mindset. Bruise Minor taking the vinculum and Scratch visiting his granddaughter in Hunger Like Fire; Kevin's story in Kiss of the Succubus; The Bandaged Man in The Beast that Haunts the Blood. <br /> <br /> I picked these apart to inform my games and how I respond as an ST, but it can be inexact.<br /> <br /> This guide articulates how Requiem works. I don't know that I will submit to the Vault, but I know my games will be better for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24634,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24634-dubiousruffian","user":"DubiousRuffian","date":". 12-11-2018, 12:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24634-dubiousruffian","name":"DubiousRuffian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"210"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T08:14:03-08:00","id":1273892,"title":"","content":"I'd love something similar for Demon as I'm prepping a game. Anyways, snagging this now <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T14:17:07-08:00","id":1273949,"title":"","content":"This book is the true Guide to the Night in my opinion. This little book, while shorter and more to the point, already contains more useful stuff than the entirety of Guide to the Night. BITE ME is everything I hoped it would be, so I'm definitely happy with this purchase!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24044,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24044-ventrue-life","user":"Ventrue Life","date":". 12-11-2018, 05:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24044-ventrue-life","name":"Ventrue Life","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24044_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"386"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T14:39:18-08:00","id":1273953,"title":"","content":"Thank you Rose! I'm looking forward to this... definitely goes on the holiday list!<br /> <br /> --Khanwulf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12493-khanwulf","name":"Khanwulf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}